; The incenter rabbit ear has TWO mirror realizations (see
; flatten-rabbit-ear-toward-c.bel); with no {toward} and both at zero derived
; given-mountains, the min-mountain canon cannot single one out — the
; statement must report the ambiguity instead of silently picking a side.

paper square

mark --diag = through .a .c
mark --ea = map --ab onto --diag
mark --eb = map --ab onto --bc
mark --ec = map --bc onto --diag

; Leading pair is (--ea .a)(--ec .c): their <180 arc is the big stayer
; sector the ear folds onto; the emergent splits it into the two mirror
; worlds {toward} then picks (design 2026-07-17 stayer convention).
flatten (--ea) (--ec) (--eb)

; expect error "ambiguous"
